    "content": "Watkins, Vernon (04/09/xxxx) \n### **Medical Admission Note**\n**Date of Admission:** 4 days ago\n<columns>\n\t<column ratio=\"37.5\">\n\t\t**Patient Name:** Vernon Watkins\n\t\t**Chief Complaint:** Nausea, vomiting and severe abdominal pain\n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"29.17\">\n\t\t**DOB:** 04/09/XXXX\n\t\t**Physician:** Dr. Jack Nelson \n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"33.33\">\n\t\t**Age/Sex:** 69-year-old male\n\t\t**Source of History:** Patient \n\t</column>\n</columns>\n### **History of Present Illness**\nMr. Watkin presented to the ER with complaints of nausea, vomiting, and severe abdominal pain x 2 days. \n<columns>\n\t<column ratio=\"25\">\n\t\t### **Past Medical History**\n\t\t- No history of surgeries \n\t\t- History of Hypertension, cataracts\n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"25\">\n\t\t### **Family History**\n\t\t- None\n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"25\">\n\t\t### **Allergies**\n\t\t- Penicillin\n\t</column>\n\t<column ratio=\"25\">\n\t\t### **Social History**\n\t\t- Lives with wife\n\t\t- Retired Postal Worker\n\t\t- Catholic\n\t\t- Smokes 1/2  pack day filtered 50 years\n\t</column>\n</columns>\n### **Assessment**\nVernon Watkins is a 69-year-old male with a history of hypertension who present to the ER with nausea, vomiting, and abdominal pain x 2 days.  Upon arrival, the patient had abdomen was firm, distended and tender. Auscultation of the abdomen revealed hypoactive bowel sounds. Abdominal xray indicated perforated bowel with free fluid in abdomen. \n### **Plan**\n1. **Admission:**\n\t- Hemicolectomy\n\t- Admit to medical surgical unit\n2. **Medication:**\n\t- Continue Home medications\n\nWatkins, Vernon (04/09/xxxx)"
