    "content": "## **PATIENT INFORMATION**\n<table header-row=\"true\">\n<tr>\n<td>**Name:** Jane Fowler</td>\n<td>**Gender Identification:** Female</td>\n<td>**Allergies:** No known allergies</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**DOB:** 1/28/XX</td>\n<td>**Age:** 79 years</td>\n<td>**Adm Provider:** Dr. Smith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Diagnosis:** pre-op hysterectomy</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n---\n## **LABORATORY REPORT**\n**Specimen Collected:** Admission\n---\n### **Venous Blood Analysis**\n### **Complete Blood Count (CBC)**\n<table header-row=\"true\">\n<tr>\n<td>Test (Reference Range)</td>\n<td>**Admission**</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Hgb (female 12–16 g/dL)**</td>\n<td>11.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**HCT (female 36–48%)**</td>\n<td>36</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**WBC (4.5–10.5 ×10⁹/L)**</td>\n<td>11.5\\*</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Platelets (150–400 ×10⁹/L)**</td>\n<td>220</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n---\n### **Basic Metabolic Panel (BMP)**\n<table header-row=\"true\">\n<tr>\n<td>Test (Reference Range)</td>\n<td>**Admission**</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Na⁺ (136–145 mEq/L)**</td>\n<td>140</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**K⁺ (3.5–5.5 mEq/L)**</td>\n<td>4.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Cl⁻ (98–106 mEq/L)**</td>\n<td>104</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**HCO₃⁻ (23–30 mEq/L)**</td>\n<td>25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**BUN (8–20 mg/dL)**</td>\n<td>18</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Creatinine (female 0.4–1.0 mg/dL)**</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Glucose (70–110 mg/dL)**</td>\n<td>108</td>\n</tr>\n<tr color=\"yellow_bg\">\n<td>Blood type </td>\n<td>A+</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n---\n### **Miscellaneous**\n<table header-row=\"true\">\n<tr>\n<td>Test</td>\n<td>**Admission**</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Pregnancy Test (hCG)**</td>\n<td>Negative</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>**Urinalysis**</td>\n<td>Negative</td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
